  "clips": [
    {
      "id": "S01",
      "file": "S01.mp3",
      "text": "2004年9月14日，光州北区，一间普通公寓。",
      "sha256": "206ae6207a6741699068cc63ec727fdcec53cedee1455ad7c24832bc25bd8b38",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉、克制的成熟普通话男声",
      "narration_id": "N01",
      "target_start": 0,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 5.232,
      "atempo": 1.0464,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S02",
      "file": "S02.mp3",
      "text": "谁也没想到，一个平常日子会变成多年悬案。",
      "sha256": "e4cc76866b3e7087cce36cbfc7b732144b432cc3a2bbb8d6abf07d9b669bb639",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉、克制的成熟普通话男声",
      "narration_id": "N01",
      "target_start": 5,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 4.296,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.704
    },
    {
      "id": "S03",
      "file": "S03.mp3",
      "text": "早上七点四十，父亲提起公文包，像往常一样出门。",
      "sha256": "9f8fa64dcb7b69849eb70bfe76c5a22b9d6642bb916a9d8f10fa9d4452618503",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉、克制的成熟普通话男声",
      "narration_id": "N02",
      "target_start": 10,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 4.656,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 2.344
    },
    {
      "id": "S04",
      "file": "S04.mp3",
      "text": "八点五十五分，母亲留下便当，轻轻关门离开。",
      "sha256": "14ed2bf510c1ebc0dd4f20953cb6df9ad84bcced7d6c25e123c5c01857865661",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉、克制的成熟普通话男声",
      "narration_id": "N02",
      "target_start": 17,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 4.56,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 2.44
    },
    {
      "id": "S05",
      "file": "S05.mp3",
      "text": "家里只剩22岁的善雅，一切看起来都和平常一样。",
      "sha256": "af36894122153a9ac89409bd71b2ca6f8dcd7fd1c41a07af05738ecc2f550cbe",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉、克制的成熟普通话男声",
      "narration_id": "N02",
      "target_start": 24,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 4.632,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 1.368
    },
    {
      "id": "S06",
      "file": "S06.mp3",
      "text": "那时楼道没有监控，也没留下可识别凶手的痕迹。",
      "sha256": "e165e1d2eef6397e4e8491ce0a72684382a6afcb1197898ce10218d45353e389",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉、克制的成熟普通话男声",
      "narration_id": "N02",
      "target_start": 30,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 4.608,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.392
    },
    {
      "id": "S07",
      "file": "S07.mp3",
      "text": "晚上八点左右，母亲结束聚会回家，还没察觉异常。",
      "sha256": "bc5ee7ee2033557496cbfb1f7b4ebb70f11cb5aebd282f257efc41a867cdd4a6",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉、克制的成熟普通话男声",
      "narration_id": "N03",
      "target_start": 35,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 5.448,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 1.552
    },
    {
      "id": "S08",
      "file": "S08.mp3",
      "text": "可刚推开门，她就发现屋里不对劲，心里猛地一沉。",
      "sha256": "cfeac0596a593919ca9547921f087c73ed5952e8f44e5fda130deb36a254f88e",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉、克制的成熟普通话男声",
      "narration_id": "N03",
      "target_start": 42,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 5.112,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 1.888
    },
    {
      "id": "S09",
      "file": "S09.mp3",
      "text": "她沿着走廊走向小房间，脚步突然停住了。",
      "sha256": "5a51521a0ee443baf7735ef10bb2591177d3ff41af4c0ab344ab827e302f23f1",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉、克制的成熟普通话男声",
      "narration_id": "N03",
      "target_start": 49,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 4.776,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 1.224
    },
    {
      "id": "S10",
      "file": "S10.mp3",
      "text": "她想拨112报警，慌乱中却按成了119。",
      "sha256": "e66cc7c24feffed12b1060abd7757a3ab211e9c0ce8a3a0f34d2e5626aae5a20",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉、克制的成熟普通话男声",
      "narration_id": "N03",
      "target_start": 55,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 4.032,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.968
    },
    {
      "id": "S11",
      "file": "S11.mp3",
      "text": "警方很快赶到，但现场没有留下明确指向凶手的线索。",
      "sha256": "174a7650a510ccec35a4a8babcee4211565e6769afe8e657d8b7793df0bdacea",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉、克制的成熟普通话男声",
      "narration_id": "N04",
      "target_start": 60,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 5.016,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 1.984
    },
    {
      "id": "S12",
      "file": "S12.mp3",
      "text": "调查人员守住房间门口，把每一件证物都固定下来。",
      "sha256": "5fc9457f7dd1062cbf50994fc60efe696dff2f87d8e551828f0446949f58af76",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉、克制的成熟普通话男声",
      "narration_id": "N04",
      "target_start": 67,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 4.272,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 2.728
    },
    {
      "id": "S13",
      "file": "S13.mp3",
      "text": "关键证物是家中的胶带和围巾，胶带长约22米。",
      "sha256": "363b7aeda4e44a2cb45a8afbcc9ed32be9ebf1fecdb34dce940dbc4b26719633",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉、克制的成熟普通话男声",
      "narration_id": "N04",
      "target_start": 74,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 5.208,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.792
    },
    {
      "id": "S14",
      "file": "S14.mp3",
      "text": "胶带被分成42段，分别封存保存至今。",
      "sha256": "ed45af0aae49156355ec74f8744a6d9f719c6cbb2a7e592c50d41226ce83cf8b",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉、克制的成熟普通话男声",
      "narration_id": "N04",
      "target_start": 80,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 3.84,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 1.16
    },
    {
      "id": "S15",
      "file": "S15.mp3",
      "text": "警方先查熟人，调阅了五百多人的通话记录。",
      "sha256": "2c60fe6b2d6fc02c572cbfdd0353ecdaa5f927cb54e0b13b20056826311c527c",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉、克制的成熟普通话男声",
      "narration_id": "N05",
      "target_start": 85,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 3.672,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 2.328
    },
    {
      "id": "S16",
      "file": "S16.mp3",
      "text": "前男友有社团证人证明，案发时他不在现场。",
      "sha256": "a3d5d5c02e69c3fd94291a1cdab6e3eeb0bea91024a1f395f132b43c542078f5",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉、克制的成熟普通话男声",
      "narration_id": "N05",
      "target_start": 91,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 4.488,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 1.512
    },
    {
      "id": "S17",
      "file": "S17.mp3",
      "text": "另一位熟悉门锁的人，也有不在场证明。",
      "sha256": "f8d1429c874bed78928bf6d150d99750c2a3d97ff0bf1924c90c4d33b3c01464",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉、克制的成熟普通话男声",
      "narration_id": "N05",
      "target_start": 97,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 3.432,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 1.568
    },
    {
      "id": "S18",
      "file": "S18.mp3",
      "text": "警方又排查相关前科者，结果仍然一无所获。",
      "sha256": "060767f6a5c6ebb4c555c39d87e0c0cac83e280978296c46d79232f70facf580",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉、克制的成熟普通话男声",
      "narration_id": "N05",
      "target_start": 102,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 4.464,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 1.536
    },
    {
      "id": "S19",
      "file": "S19.mp3",
      "text": "调查陷入僵局：凶手到底是熟人，还是陌生人？",
      "sha256": "c651cd8a75cddd669a12714554b0a04407f3a4ab48cd0a177e32bf6ca8450114",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉、克制的成熟普通话男声",
      "narration_id": "N06",
      "target_start": 108,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 4.848,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 1.152
    },
    {
      "id": "S20",
      "file": "S20.mp3",
      "text": "专家注意到，胶带和围巾都是家中物品。",
      "sha256": "7f68053fd78ce1c769679f8263f4f975187a899a64a212aae39521c8130bf420",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉、克制的成熟普通话男声",
      "narration_id": "N06",
      "target_start": 114,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 3.672,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 2.328
    },
    {
      "id": "S21",
      "file": "S21.mp3",
      "text": "陌生人入室后，也可能临时取用胶带。",
      "sha256": "23e0a7350c28678b7dd03d94ffd515d375b6bf14144116f2c275daaefe094df7",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉、克制的成熟普通话男声",
      "narration_id": "N06",
      "target_start": 120,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 3.24,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 1.76
    },
    {
      "id": "S22",
      "file": "S22.mp3",
      "text": "但这只是专家推测，不能当成定论。",
      "sha256": "ca09bcffa38a640e3d9f41db36cc34708059440e7ec4f65042408c3abac5d0ae",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉、克制的成熟普通话男声",
      "narration_id": "N06",
      "target_start": 125,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 3.168,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 1.832
    },
    {
      "id": "S23",
      "file": "S23.mp3",
      "text": "直到2016年，警方重新检验封存多年的旧证物。",
      "sha256": "6044b6c2460a1205f882e38cdcaaf52353428ae1240f1df6712cab788c3e385b",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉、克制的成熟普通话男声",
      "narration_id": "N07",
      "target_start": 130,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 4.92,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 2.08
    },
    {
      "id": "S24",
      "file": "S24.mp3",
      "text": "胶带和围巾上，检出极微量男性Y染色体信息。",
      "sha256": "326de2d52a8370d172276d955b4c52fd561f395abfb46e904b89f6c4ed54387f",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉、克制的成熟普通话男声",
      "narration_id": "N07",
      "target_start": 137,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 4.656,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 2.344
    },
    {
      "id": "S25",
      "file": "S25.mp3",
      "text": "父系分析指向两个姓氏，但节目公开时仍未匹配。",
      "sha256": "ecd5c9cd6cfb97e06a45a6b38e5a1a04c7f9cde35bb83fdc2e7cfed5afbd76d5",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉、克制的成熟普通话男声",
      "narration_id": "N07",
      "target_start": 144,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 5.04,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.96
    },
    {
      "id": "S26",
      "file": "S26.mp3",
      "text": "2015年修法，适用死刑的杀人罪不再受时效限制。",
      "sha256": "9c024273c78b57ebd4e9a01d6e74cdbf01da84e5d1e81009b6b080f2c06a5b4b",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉、克制的成熟普通话男声",
      "narration_id": "N08",
      "target_start": 150,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 4.968,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 1.032
    },
    {
      "id": "S27",
      "file": "S27.mp3",
      "text": "这起旧案当时尚未届满，所以仍然可以追诉。",
      "sha256": "e69ef78b84846c8b7eaa1de957f9cac940ab900e82af2670ee9766e4fc542a1d",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉、克制的成熟普通话男声",
      "narration_id": "N08",
      "target_start": 156,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 4.104,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 1.896
    },
    {
      "id": "S28",
      "file": "S28.mp3",
      "text": "公寓后来才装上监控，而那些证物仍被保存。",
      "sha256": "985496065386ade2766f7638433e30fbb729bf33bd36c08e54aded754f0823dc",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉、克制的成熟普通话男声",
      "narration_id": "N08",
      "target_start": 162,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 4.272,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 1.728
    },
    {
      "id": "S29",
      "file": "S29.mp3",
      "text": "母亲曾说，那一天，她仿佛也跟女儿一起死去。",
      "sha256": "256eceddafc1fa3406421f9a0f6882c09d3269a394028b553a209a5651055eee",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉、克制的成熟普通话男声",
      "narration_id": "N09",
      "target_start": 168,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 4.2,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 1.8
    },
    {
      "id": "S30",
      "file": "S30.mp3",
      "text": "节目公开时仍未匹配。你觉得，是熟人还是陌生人？",
      "sha256": "4fcfe395196ab413361d05b8e232649d25715caf4b0634c34c42be779492a231",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
